{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Getting started","anchor":"Getting-started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService"]}],"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"QuickStart"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"1. Add the SDK","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"1-Add-the-SDK"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YEOFR","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Swift package","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"https:\/\/github.com\/yeo-messaging\/YEOFR-SPM","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") to your project, pinned to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exact version ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"0.11.2","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", then ","type":"text"},{"code":"import YEOFR","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The binary ships device","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"arm64","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and Apple-silicon simulator (","type":"text"},{"code":"arm64","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") slices, so an app and its tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"build either way — but recognition needs a real device and stays inert on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"simulator.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"2. Pilot unlock for non-YEO bundle IDs","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"2-Pilot-unlock-for-non-YEO-bundle-IDs"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"YEOFR is gated to YEO-owned apps by default; a non-YEO bundle id aborts on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"construction. Evaluation customers get a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"temporary unlock code","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bypasses the gate during a fixed pilot window — email","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"christo@yeomessaging.com","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" to request one. Pass it to the initializer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(step 3). YEO-owned apps pass the gate natively.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"3. Drive everything with `FaceTrustService`","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"3-Drive-everything-with-FaceTrustService"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService","type":"reference"},{"text":" is the turnkey entry point. It owns the engine, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"camera, the fused-trust pipeline (face recognition + liveness CNN +","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TrueDepth), the identity gate, and tracker persistence, and exposes two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"streams: one for live trust verdicts and one for guided enrolment.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import YEOFR","","let service = FaceTrustService(pilotUnlockCode: \"YOUR-PILOT-CODE\")","","\/\/ Attach the preview to an AVCaptureVideoPreviewLayer:","\/\/   previewLayer.session = service.previewSession","","try await service.start()    \/\/ warm-up, restore enrolment, arm gate, start camera"]},{"style":"important","type":"aside","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"start()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" owns engine warm-up, and there is no public API to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"trigger it yourself. This is deliberate — warm-up must complete before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first template is extracted, and an engine that is only half-warm answers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enrolment with a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"mismatched embedding","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" rather than an error. Awaiting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"start()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before you enrol or match is the whole contract.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"text":"4. Enrol a face","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"4-Enrol-a-face"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"enroll(name:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" captures the next frame holding a single face, persists the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gallery, and re-arms the identity gate. Iterate the returned stream to coach","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["for await step in service.enroll(name: \"Alice\") {","    switch step.phase {","    case .capturing: show(step.prompt)","    case .completed: dismiss()","    case .failed:    show(step.prompt)","    @unknown default: break","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One capture is enough to separate the enrolled user from other people. Call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it again under other angles\/lighting to improve recall — each capture adds a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sample to the same identity, up to 25 samples; captures after the 25th","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report success but are not kept.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"enroll(name:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a quick start. The full enrolment is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", a guided five-pose walk your app drives from its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own camera loop.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"text":"…or enrol from photos you already have","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"or-enrol-from-photos-you-already-have"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No camera needed. Hand the SDK your reference images — a KYC set of three,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or thirty — and every usable one becomes a sample of the same identity:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let codes = await service.enroll(name: \"Alice\", images: kycPhotos)","let rejected = codes.enumerated().filter { $0.element != .OK }   \/\/ e.g. .imageNoFaceDetected"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Codes are index-aligned with ","type":"text"},{"code":"images","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so a partly-usable set tells you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exactly which photos landed.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"5. Run live recognition","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"5-Run-live-recognition"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["for await update in service.updates() {","    switch update.status {","    case .trusted:    badge(\"TRUSTED — \\(update.matchedName ?? \"\")\", .green)","    case .notTrusted: badge(\"NOT TRUSTED\", .red)","    case .badFraming: badge(\"ADJUST FRAMING\", .orange)","    case .noFace:     badge(\"NO FACE\", .gray)","    @unknown default: break","    }","    \/\/ update.livenessGenuine \/ update.depthIsThreeD are the contributing signals.","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"update.status == .trusted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" already fuses face recognition, liveness, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TrueDepth, with framing applied — you never pick a similarity threshold,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and you never touch the identity gate (forgetting it would collapse trust","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to liveness + depth, so any live face would pass). The enrolled gallery is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"saved across launches automatically; ","type":"text"},{"code":"service.enrolledName","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reflects who is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enrolled.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"See also","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"See-also"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A complete, runnable SwiftUI app lives in the package’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Examples\/FRPilot","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService","type":"reference"},{"text":" — full API.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustUpdate","type":"reference"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/EnrollmentProgress","type":"reference"},{"text":" — the stream payloads.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Recognise the enrolled user and reject everyone else, in a few lines.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/quickstart"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/quickstart"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/QuickStart","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR"]]},"references":{"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService":{"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Turnkey entry point for on-device face recognition with fused liveness"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and TrueDepth anti-spoofing."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FaceTrustService"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FaceTrustService","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"FaceTrustService","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService/enroll(name:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enroll"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"name"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EnrollmentProgress","preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR18EnrollmentProgressV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice\/enroll(name:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"enroll(name:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/enroll(name:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enrol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"name"},{"type":"text","text":" from the live camera and return a stream of capture"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"progress. The existing frame loop captures the next frame holding a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single face; the service then persists the gallery, refreshes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"enrolledName","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", resets the trust pipeline against the fresh gallery, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-arms the identity gate — the consumer does none of that."}]},"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"On-device face recognition with fused liveness and TrueDepth anti-spoofing."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"YEOFR"},"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService/updates()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"updates","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"FaceTrustUpdate","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR15FaceTrustUpdateV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice\/updates()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"updates()","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/updates()","abstract":[{"text":"Per-frame trust verdicts for the recognition UI. Call once and iterate;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the stream finishes on ","type":"text"},{"code":"stop()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Newest-wins (the underlying camera"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"stream drops stale frames), so a slow consumer can’t back up memory."}]},"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/PoseWalkEnrollment":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PoseWalkEnrollment"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PoseWalkEnrollment"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/posewalkenrollment","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"PoseWalkEnrollment","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The guided enrolment recipe: 